OL,3,AFarage defends Reform's vetting after
OL,4,Acouncillors filmed making racist
OL,5,Acomments
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This report contains racist
OL,8,Fand offensive language.
OL,10,FNigel Farage has insisted Reform UK
OL,11,Fdoes not have an issue with vetting,
OL,12,Fafter ITV News broadcast undercover
OL,13,Ffilming of some of its councillors and
OL,14,Fcandidates using racist, violent and
OL,15,Fsexist language.
OL,17,FThe Reform leader told BBC Look East
OL,18,Fhis party vetted "to a much higher
OL,19,Fstandard than other parties" but "you
OL,20,Fcan't vet for future comments".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
